      "locked": false,
      "text": "Setpoints only in S4, S5, S6. Solid: commands and progress rules. Dashed: telemetry-driven and contingency transitions.",
      "originalText": "Setpoints only in S4, S5, S6. Solid: commands and progress rules. Dashed: telemetry-driven and contingency transitions.",
